BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:UEsi5KKEXH9x4FdCb6LP@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:SSP  M1 Summer Planning
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:The summer between your first and second year of medical school is a valuable opportunity to recharge\, explore professional interests\, and prepare for the transition into M2. Join SSP for an informative session focused on making the most of your M1 summer! We'll discuss opportunities to get involved in research\, pursue clinical and volunteer experiences\, strengthen your CV\, explore specialty interests\, prepare for board examinations\, and develop habits that will set you up for success in your second year. Whether you're looking to get ahead academically\, build your professional portfolio\, or simply make the most of your time outside the classroom\, this session will provide practical advice\, helpful resources\, and strategies to make your summer both productive and rewarding.\n\nMeeting Link: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/2557603154355892?p=DPqRzcy6aPNW0r5jMg\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378193
DTSTART:20261204T000000Z
DTEND:20261204T010000Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:WbFkgeZdyRF6FeZ3gp9h@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:MWU SASA Diwali Banquet
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:South Asian Students Association would like to cordially invite you to celebrate Diwali with us at our Diwali Banquet on Friday December 4th at 6pm. There will be amazing food\, henna\, games\, music\, and more! Traditional attire is also encouraged. Please register on the CARS portal at your earliest convenience. Non-MWU friends and family are also welcome to attend! \n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378214
DTSTART:20261204T200000Z
DTEND:20261205T040000Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:FMEE84DmIsahCdB5vvCr@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:SAVMA Pickleball Tournament
LOCATION:Rec Center Gym AND Outdoor Basketball Courts\,
DESCRIPTION:Kick off winter quarter with a fun\, competitive 2v2 pickleball tournament! Teams of two are welcome\, and significant others can participate as long as one teammate is a current MWU student. All skill levels are welcome\, and matching outfits are encouraged! Registration is $20 per team ($10 per person)\, with some exciting prizes for the top three placing teams. Tournament will be held on campus on the basketball courts and in the rec center\, with pool play and bracket-style competition. The event will take place December 4th–6th\, with the goal of wrapping up by Saturday if possible. Enjoy concessions\, a bake sale\, and other goodies throughout the event. Come compete\, have fun\, and show off your team spirit!\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378012
DTSTART:20261204T230000Z
DTEND:20261207T020000Z
END:VEVENT
