BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:m1zJmGLga4hikppe5WJH@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Forensic Science: A Guest Lecture with Kim Kobojek
LOCATION:AH 204\, 555 31st Street\, Downers Grove\, IL 60515\, United States
DESCRIPTION:Join the Pathology and Precision Medicine Club for a special lunch talk featuring Kim Kobojek\, a current Forensic Scientist with the Arizona Department of Public Safety. Ms. Kobojek brings more than 30 years of experience in forensic science and has worked closely with the Maricopa County Medical Examiner’s Office on a wide range of forensic cases.\n\nStudents will meet in person for this event while Ms. Kobojek joins us virtually to share interesting cases from her career and discuss the role of forensic science in investigations and laboratory analysis. She will also discuss how the field of forensic science has evolved over the past several decades.\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378132
DTSTART:20261208T180000Z
DTEND:20261208T190000Z
END:VEVENT
